[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a>\n                                           .</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow all the recommended safety\nrules 5580C</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Position the front wheels perfectly straight\nand mark the position of the steering wheel in relation to the upper\ncasing.</p><p>1. Remove the protective ring.</p><p>2. Undo the nut (2a) and remove steering wheel (2b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The steering wheel fixing nut\nmust be replaced each time it is dismantled.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044805.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the steering wheel\nin its housing check that the marks made previously on the steering\nwheel and the upper half casing are aligned.</p><p>Tighten a new steering wheel fixing nut\nto the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>STEERING WHEEL</p></td><td><p>M16</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.5 ÷ 5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2429452\">5580C18</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]